I examined all 36 registration sites and their 35 distinct callback pairs. They do not establish a preference for latched warnings: SH3 has silent TODO handlers, while PCC2 terminates on an unsupported delivery mode. The Alpha PALcode code also offers a third precedent: diagnose unsupported emulation and stop the guest CPU.
